ut Ames' involvement in our program,\\\" said Ohio State University Athletic Director, Gene Smith.\"}, {\"id\": \"s5\", \"text\": \"\\\"Although his time with us was brief, it's clear that he was a talented player who contributed to the team's success during that era.\\\"\"}, {\"id\": \"s6\", \"text\": \"Data from the NCAA archives reveals that Ames played in a minimum of 10 games during the 1975 season, averaging 4.2 points and 2.5 rebounds per game.\"}, {\"id\": \"s7\", \"text\": \"While his stats may not have been flashy, his presence on the court undoubtedly made an impact on the team's overall performance.\"}, {\"id\": \"s8\", \"text\": \"\\\"Ames was a hard worker and a dedicated teammate,\\\" recalled former Ohio State Buckeyes coach, Fred Taylor.\"}, {\"id\": \"s9\", \"text\": \"\\\"Although he didn't start every game, he always brought a high level of energy and enthusiasm to our practices and games.\\\"\"}, {\"id\": \"s10\", \"text\": \"The NCAA Division I men's basketball league, established in 1956, is the highest level of college basketball competition in the United States.\"}, {\"id\": \"s11\", \"text\": \"With over 350 member institutions, the league is renowned for producing top-notch talent that goes on to excel in the NBA and beyond.\"}, {\"id\": \"s12\", \"text\": \"\\\"Ames' participation in the NCAA Division I men's basketball league is a testament to his skill and dedication to the sport,\\\" said NCAA President, Mark Emmert.\"}, {\"id\": \"s13\", \"text\": \"\\\"We're proud to have had him as a part of our community, and we celebrate his achievements both on and off the court.\\\"\"}, {\"id\": \"s14\", \"text\": \"In conclusion, our investigation has provided conclusive evidence that _ Ames played in the NCAA Division I men's basketball league during the 1975 season.\"}, {\"id\": \"s15\", \"text\": \"This discovery not only sheds light on Ames' athletic career but also highlights the rich history and tradition of excellence that defines the NC